out.push(A('Each reads the four-word concession at speaking speed and then the one restored. ⚠ **Listen for the lean**: a student who stresses _for all its cost_ has made the concession the main clause with the voice, **and the sentence then concedes in print and concedes aloud as well.** Then the sentence the cycle ends on, which is Mrs Khoury\'s and is the whole argument for compression: **the page is shorter and concedes more visibly, and the two are the same fact.**'));
