out.push(A('**2** _"It doubles the laboratory\'s work for a fortnight, and the fortnight is February."_ The concession does not touch **the figure for the year**: thirty-one disputes at about four hours each is a hundred and twenty-four hours of argument, against a fortnight of double handling.'));
out.push(A('**3** That the hundred and twenty-four hours are **not all hers** — about half fall on the directorate and the depots, **so she is asking her own laboratory to pay in February for a saving other people collect in August.** And she would let go of it if **February runs with second portions and the disputes do not fall below twenty**: the proposal has then failed on its own figure and she will say so in writing.'));
