out.push(A('⚠ **The essay is the task the whole unit builds and the question names its own notes: the time it takes, what happens when nobody can remember, and the candidate\'s own idea.** All three, or the content mark goes. **Mark the three off before reading for language.** The second note is the one to concede against, and **the own idea belongs in the last paragraph, where it is read** — a candidate who puts it second has buried the only original thing in the script.'));
out.push(A('**And the two faults that will dominate the scripts.** ⚠ **_However, some people say…_ as the last sentence**, which ends the essay on the other side\'s case and is worth a whole band. And **a concession paragraph of a hundred words**, which takes the essay to three hundred with the third note unwritten. **Both are fixed by one instruction: objection first, sixty words, multiply by three.**'));
