out.push(S('Unit 9 check · C  Writing'));
out.push(A('The essay, and marked on four things only: **are there four paragraphs with the concession paragraph third; is the objection in the first sentence of that paragraph; is there a figure in sentence four; and are all three notes answered, with the candidate\'s own idea last?** ⚠ Nothing else is assessed. An essay whose concession paragraph is last has failed 9.6 whatever else is right, and an essay of three hundred words has failed on length before a reader reaches the content — **and the two faults travel together**, because the paragraph that ends the essay is also the one nobody counted.'));
out.push(S('I can… (Unit 9)'));
out.push(A('Self-assessment; no answers. The four that matter are the second, the third, the sixth and the eighth: **conceding with a full stop and withdrawing your own weaker version**, **one limit about a different thing**, **pricing somebody else\'s concession by what it cost the writer**, and **showing that both parties have conceded.** ⚠ A class that ticks the first and the fifth and not those four has learnt to write a concession that costs nothing, **which is the one outcome this unit is designed to prevent.**'));
